Description: Rust (candle) inference for the Imajev image decision model (CUDA build)
 imajev classifies images against the options you set, with a probability on
 each answer and an explicit can't-tell. It runs the Qwen3.5-4B vision model
 with the Imajev LoRA adapter locally via candle (CLI, JSONL batch and an HTTP
 server), downloading the model files from Hugging Face on first use.
 This build is linked against CUDA and needs an NVIDIA GPU with a host driver
 compatible with the CUDA toolkit version it was built against (see
 https://github.com/apiplant/imajev-rs/blob/main/packaging/README.md).
 libcuda1 (installed by the NVIDIA driver package) satisfies the runtime
 link; it does not by itself guarantee driver/toolkit compatibility.
